  <td style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">All Lucyd collateral material,
artwork, subscriber lists, eyeglass model and frame shots and renders, as well as 3D models.</span></td></tr>

<tr style="vertical-align: top">
