  <td style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">All Lucyd logos such as,
but not limited to: Lucyd<sup>&#174;</sup> word mark, Lucyd Hexagon, Upgrade Your Eyewear<sup>&#174;</sup> slogan and the Vyrb<sup>&#174;
</sup>trademark.</span></td></tr>

<tr style="vertical-align: top">
    <td>&#160;</td>
  <td style="text-align: justify">&#160;</td>
  <td style="text-align: justify">&#160;</td></tr>
<tr style="vertical-align: top">
