  <td style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">All Lucyd company developed
software and any new software developed by Innovative Eyewear, utilizing the Lucyd software, will be owned by Innovative Eyewear.</span></td></tr>

<tr style="vertical-align: top">
    <td>&#160;</td>
  <td style="text-align: justify">&#160;</td>
  <td style="text-align: justify">&#160;</td></tr>
<tr style="vertical-align: top">
    <td>&#160;</td>
  <td style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">6.</span></td>
  <td style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Lucyd Store portals through
Shopify, Amazon and Walmart.</span></td></tr>

<tr style="vertical-align: top">
    <td>&#160;</td>
  <td style="text-align: justify">&#160;</td>
  <td style="text-align: justify">&#160;</td></tr>
