  <td style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Relevant websites domain names
including Lucyd.co, Lucyd.net, Lucyd.eu.</span></td></tr>

<tr style="vertical-align: top">
