    <td style="width: 1%; text-align: left"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 8pt">&#160;</span></td><td style="width: 6%; text-align: right"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 8pt">114,758</span></td><td style="width: 1%; text-align: left"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 8pt">&#160;</span></td></tr>
  <tr style="vertical-align: bottom; background-color: rgb(204,238,255)">
    <td style="text-align: left; text-indent: -0.125in; padding-left: 0.125in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 8pt">Chief
