<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0in 0pt 0.35in; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">All
of these stock options issued under our 2021 Equity Incentive Plan are subject to time-based vesting, except for Mr. Castro&#8217;s July&#160;21,
2021 option grant that vests upon an acquisition or flotation at a valuation greater than or equal to four times (400%) the most recent
published annual Company valuation (2020: $2.7 million).</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.25in; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>



