800,817 shares of common stock issuable upon exercise of stock options held by Mr. Gross exercisable within 60 days of the date of this
10-K.</span></td>
</tr></table>



<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0in; margin-bottom: 0in; width: 100%"><tr style="vertical-align: top; border-collapse: collapse">
<td style="text-align: justify; width: 0in"></td><td style="width: 0.25in; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">(3)</span></td><td style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Includes
64,986 shares of common stock issuable upon exercise of stock options held by Mr. Dabrowski exercisable within 60 days of the date of
this 10-K.</span></td>
</tr></table>



<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0in; margin-bottom: 0in; width: 100%"><tr style="vertical-align: top; border-collapse: collapse">
